      "title": "East Carolina University Portal",
      "description": "East Carolina University Portal | Federal Work Study - LWCC Student Assistants Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Applicant Interest Card Notifications Log In /Create Account Help Applicants Have Rights Under Federal Employment Laws Immigration Law Related Notices Relocation Assistance Program Working at ECU Federal Work Study - LWCC Student Assistants Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Advertising Department STUDENT LIFE Academic Term/Year FALL 2026/SPRING 2027 Position Title Federal Work Study - LWCC Student Assistants Posting Number 08410 Position Number 08410 Student Job Category Student - Federal Work Study On-Campus Position Location On-campus City Greenville State NC Number of Vacancies 6 Rate of Pay $10.50/hrly FLSA Status FLSA Non-exempt Will the position be subject to the CBC policy? No Job Description ECU Department of Student Life is currently seeking several LWCC Student Assistants. The Ledonia Wright Cultural Center ( LWCC ) is seeking motivated and dedicated full-time undergraduate students for the Student Assistant position for the Fall 2026 – Spring 2027 academic year. As a Student Assistant, you will represent the LWCC at resource fairs, assist with the general upkeep of the center, and other general tasks as assigned. The LWCC Student Assistant role fosters personal growth by cultivating cultural competency and contributing to a sense of community. This is an excellent opportunity for students to gain practical experience, develop professionally, and make a meaningful impact while attending East Carolina University. General Responsibilities: Staff front desk and welcome visitors to the center Assist with general office upkeep to ensure a clean and organized environment for visitors Represent the LWCC at information fairs and programs, sharing details about the center’s resources and events Supporting events from setup to ending Knowledge, Skills 