    "https://ecu.peopleadmin.com/postings/96119": {
      "title": "East Carolina University Portal",
      "description": "East Carolina University Portal | Federal Work Study - Lab Assistants Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Applicant Interest Card Notifications Log In /Create Account Help Applicants Have Rights Under Federal Employment Laws Immigration Law Related Notices Relocation Assistance Program Working at ECU Federal Work Study - Lab Assistants Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Advertising Department BIOLOGY, DEPT OF Academic Term/Year FALL 2026/SPRING 2027 Position Title Federal Work Study - Lab Assistants Posting Number 08485 Position Number 08485 Student Job Category Student - Federal Work Study On-Campus Position Location On-campus City Greenville State NC Number of Vacancies 3 Rate of Pay $12.00/hourly FLSA Status FLSA Non-exempt Will the position be subject to the CBC policy? No Job Description ECU Department of Biology is currently seeking several Lab Assistants to help set up and maintain materials for BIOL 1051 and BIOL 1101 lab courses. This position will include: Washing glassware Caring for small organisms Making solutions All student employees are required to follow lab specific safety protocols. GPA Requirement Minimum of 2.5 Preferred (Majors, Experience, GPA, etc.) This position requires basic science knowledge, organizational skills, working independently, and working in a group setting. All majors accepted. However, science majors such as those listed below are preferred. Biology Biochemistry Chemistry Earth & Atmospheric Sciences Environmental Studies Geography & Geospatial Data Science Mathematics Neuroscience Physics Psychology License/certification required Special Instructions to Applicant Please upload your resume, Federal Work Study Hiring Authorization Form, references, and course schedule online. To be ELIGIBLE for FEDERAL WORK STUDY POSITIONS , students MUST QUALIFY and RECEIVE an AWARD from the ECU Financial Aid Office (Old Cafeteria Complex, 25